---
description: React Compiler conventions
globs: "**/*.{ts,tsx}"
---

React Compiler is enabled. Do not add `useMemo` or `useCallback` for routine render optimization or stable JSX props; let the compiler memoize them.

Only use explicit memoization when changing the reference without changing its captured values would change behavior, such as an external identity-based registry or a documented stable callback contract.

JSX props and paired effect setup/cleanup do not qualify. Define effect-only functions inside the effect.
